ast one of 6,12 true, 10 must be true. So variable 10 forced true.\n\nNow we have forced: 2,7,10,11 true. Others free? Variables 1,3,4,5,6,8,9,12 maybe.\n\nBut we must also satisfy clauses with these forced values.\n\nCheck clause 1: -8 or 2. 2 true, so clause satisfied regardless of 8. So no constraint on 8.\n\nClause 10: -1 or 2"}}],"created":1790947111,"model":"C:\\Users\\d2j3\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-09-10\\napraw\\outputs\\moon-native\\models\\gpt-oss-20b-MXFP4.gguf","system_fingerprint":"b10809-5266f24da","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":768,"prompt_tokens":4195,"total_tokens":4963,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-TUvuhZu1GZ1K8EZQCEtvMfoZLTP0xLbM","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":4195,"prompt_ms":538.428,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.12834994040524433,"prompt_per_second":7791.199566144406,"predicted_n":768,"predicted_ms":2335.137,"predicted_per_token_ms":3.0445071707953066,"predicted_per_second":328.4603858360344}}